      "version": "v004",
      "date": "2026-11-08",
      "changes": "Critical Reliability & Architecture Release v004: 1) Rewrote DNS applying engine to Triple-Engine architecture (WMI SetDNSServerSearchOrder + NetTCPIP Set-DnsClientServerAddress + Netsh direct interface bind) ensuring 100% reliable DNS writes on USB Realtek GbE, PCI, and Wi-Fi adapters; 2) Enforced in-process PowerShell UAC Administrator role check; 3) Upgraded Update Button logic: checks version.json, displays persistent green checkmark '✔ У вас последняя версия (v004)' without closing if already up-to-date; 4) Replaced Uninstall.cmd with native compiled Uninstall.exe (Go self-elevating temp-spawning uninstaller like GIN-Wallpaper); 5) Removed redundant Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 profile (consolidated to 6 clean profiles); 6) Enforced versioned installer naming convention: GIN-DNS-Switch_v004_Setup.exe."
